1	# Contract: `RecordsBloc` (`lib/features/records/presentation/bloc/records_bloc.dart`)
2	
3	The one bloc behind "Meus Registros." Depends only on `EntriesRepository` (domain interface) — never
4	`SessionRepository`, `ConnectivityChecker`, nor (critically, requirements.md RF07's own acceptance criterion)
5	`SessionBloc` or any of its event/state types.
6	
7	```dart
8	class RecordsBloc extends Bloc<RecordsEvent, RecordsState> {
9	  RecordsBloc({required this._entriesRepository}) : super(RecordsLoading()) {
10	    on<RecordsStarted>(_onStarted);
11	    on<NextPageRequested>(_onNextPageRequested);
12	    on<PageLoadRetried>(_onPageLoadRetried);
13	    on<RecordsLocalCacheRefreshed>(_onLocalCacheRefreshed);
14	  }
15	
16	  final EntriesRepository _entriesRepository;
17	  final _reauthController = StreamController<void>.broadcast();
18	  Stream<void> get reauthRequired => _reauthController.stream;
19	}
20	```
21	
22	## `_onStarted` / `_onPageLoadRetried` (first page)
23	
24	```dart
25	Future<void> _onStarted(RecordsStarted event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
26	  emit(RecordsLoading());
27	  await _loadFirstPage(emit);
28	}
29	
30	Future<void> _onPageLoadRetried(PageLoadRetried event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
31	  final current = state;
32	  if (current is RecordsLoadFailure) {
33	    emit(RecordsLoading());
34	    await _loadFirstPage(emit);
35	  } else if (current is RecordsLoaded && current.pageLoadFailure != null) {
36	    await _fetchNextPage(current, emit);   // retries the same unconsumed cursor
37	  }
38	}
39	
40	Future<void> _loadFirstPage(Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
41	  final result = await _entriesRepository.list();
42	  result.match(
43	    (failure) {
44	      if (failure is AuthExpiredFailure) _reauthController.add(null);   // research.md R5 — fires regardless
45	      emit(RecordsLoadFailure(failure));                                 // never the empty state (data-model.md)
46	    },
47	    (page) => emit(RecordsLoaded(
48	      entries: EntryMerger.merge(primary: page.entries, secondary: _entriesRepository.cachedEntries),
49	      nextCursor: page.nextCursor,
50	      isLoadingMore: false,
51	    )),
52	  );
53	}
54	```
55	
56	## `_onNextPageRequested` (further pages)
57	
58	```dart
59	Future<void> _onNextPageRequested(NextPageRequested event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
60	  final current = state;
61	  if (current is! RecordsLoaded || current.hasReachedEnd || current.isLoadingMore) return;
62	  await _fetchNextPage(current, emit);
63	}
64	
65	Future<void> _fetchNextPage(RecordsLoaded current, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) async {
66	  emit(RecordsLoaded(
67	    entries: current.entries, nextCursor: current.nextCursor, isLoadingMore: true,
68	  ));
69	  final result = await _entriesRepository.list(cursor: current.nextCursor);
70	  result.match(
71	    (failure) {
72	      if (failure is AuthExpiredFailure) {
73	        _reauthController.add(null);
74	        // entries/cursor unchanged, isLoadingMore resets to false, no pageLoadFailure — FR-007
75	        emit(RecordsLoaded(entries: current.entries, nextCursor: current.nextCursor, isLoadingMore: false));
76	      } else {
77	        emit(RecordsLoaded(
78	          entries: current.entries, nextCursor: current.nextCursor,
79	          isLoadingMore: false, pageLoadFailure: failure,   // retryable banner, entries untouched (FR-009)
80	        ));
81	      }
82	    },
83	    (page) => emit(RecordsLoaded(
84	      entries: EntryMerger.merge(primary: current.entries + page.entries, secondary: _entriesRepository.cachedEntries),
85	      nextCursor: page.nextCursor,
86	      isLoadingMore: false,
87	    )),
88	  );
89	}
90	```
91	
92	- If the fetched page is itself empty but `nextCursor` is non-null (Edge Cases — "most recent page of entries
93	  is itself empty... paging continues to load those older groups"), this still emits a normal `RecordsLoaded`
94	  with no new entries added and the new `nextCursor` carried forward — `RecordsPage`'s `ScrollController`
95	  listener simply requests the *next* page too, since `hasReachedEnd` is still `false`.
96	- Reaching the true end (`nextCursor: null`) just stops future `NextPageRequested` dispatch (`hasReachedEnd`
97	  guard above) — "no error, no 'end of list' case to treat as a failure" (Edge Cases) is satisfied by there
98	  being no distinct state for it at all.
99	
100	## `_onLocalCacheRefreshed` (research.md R10 — after the insertion modal closes)
101	
102	```dart
103	void _onLocalCacheRefreshed(RecordsLocalCacheRefreshed event, Emitter<RecordsState> emit) {
104	  final current = state;
105	  if (current is! RecordsLoaded) return;   // nothing to merge into before the first page even loads
106	  emit(RecordsLoaded(
107	    entries: EntryMerger.merge(primary: current.entries, secondary: _entriesRepository.cachedEntries),
108	    nextCursor: current.nextCursor, isLoadingMore: current.isLoadingMore,
109	    pageLoadFailure: current.pageLoadFailure,
110	  ));
111	}
112	```
113	
114	No network call — purely re-reads `EntriesRepository.cachedEntries` (already updated by `CreateEntryUseCase`
115	by the time the modal's `showModalBottomSheet` future resolves) and re-merges (FR-004, SC-001).
116	
117	## `close()`
118	
119	```dart
120	@override
121	Future<void> close() {
122	  unawaited(_reauthController.close());
123	  return super.close();
124	}
125	```
