156	## Test scenarios this contract owns (for `/speckit-tasks` to schedule)
157	
158	| # | Scenario | Expected |
159	|---|---|---|
160	| 1 | `RecordsStarted`, repository returns a page | `RecordsLoaded` with merged/deduped entries, `isLoadingMore: false` |
161	| 2 | `RecordsStarted`, repository fails (non-auth) | `RecordsLoadFailure`, `reauthRequired` does **not** fire |
162	| 3 | `RecordsStarted`, repository fails `AuthExpiredFailure` | `RecordsLoadFailure` **and** `reauthRequired` fires exactly once |
163	| 4 | `NextPageRequested` while `hasReachedEnd` | no-op, no state emitted |
164	| 5 | `NextPageRequested` while `isLoadingMore` | no-op (no duplicate concurrent fetch) |
165	| 6 | `NextPageRequested` succeeds | entries appended, not replaced; existing entries' identity preserved |
166	| 7 | `NextPageRequested` fails `AuthExpiredFailure` | entries/`nextCursor` unchanged, `pageLoadFailure` stays `null`, `reauthRequired` fires |
167	| 8 | `NextPageRequested` fails (non-auth) | entries unchanged, `pageLoadFailure` set, `reauthRequired` does not fire |
168	| 9 | `PageLoadRetried` from `RecordsLoadFailure` | re-attempts the first page |
169	| 10 | `PageLoadRetried` from a `pageLoadFailure` | re-attempts the same `nextCursor`, not a reload |
170	| 11 | `RecordsLocalCacheRefreshed` after a local `create()` | the newly cached entry appears, deduped if also later re-fetched |
171	| 12 | Fetched page is empty but `nextCursor` non-null | emits normally; no transition to an empty-account display |
172	| 13 | A fetched page contains a `chat`-sourced entry | renders without throwing (depends on research.md R2) |
173	
