175	`test/architecture/no_bloc_imports_bloc_test.dart` for `/speckit-tasks` to schedule): no file under any
176	`presentation/bloc/` folder imports another feature's `presentation/bloc/` path. `records_bloc.dart` must pass
177	this; `records_page.dart` (not a bloc file) is exempt and is exactly where the one sanctioned
178	`SessionBloc`/`AuthExpiredDetected` import lives.
